{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04766","headline":"温泉冯刘二监客舍观妓 · 张说","name":"温泉冯刘二监客舍观妓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"温谷寒林薄，羣游乐事多。\n佳人蹀骏马，乘月夜相过。\n秀色然红黛，娇香发绮罗。\n镜前鸾对舞，琴里凤传歌。\n妬宠倾新意，衔恩奈老何。\n爲君留上客，欢笑敛双蛾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04766.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04766","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}